section.invoiceRules:
(1) For a single invoice under ¥200, or official transfer invoices, only an e-invoice PDF is required;
(2) For ¥200 or more and not official transfer, enter actual payment amount and upload payment records (Alipay/WeChat transaction pages, not Taobao product pages); explain any amount mismatch;
(3) Invoice title must be UESTC with tax ID 121000004507193117;
(4) Upload an explanation if issuer and payee differ; cash and private transfers are not supported.
